The original raw captures and telemetry are not included. The release includes
canonicalized ground-truth events, processed window metadata, and detector
outputs derived from the dataset. Canonicalization assigns event identifiers,
normalizes timestamps, and records campaign identifiers and durations. These
materials retain any applicable upstream terms; they are not relicensed under
MIT. Retain the dataset attribution and license information when sharing them.

Please cite the dataset and its associated paper independently of this code:
